    {
      "v": 7,
      "zh": "王便大怒，起来离开酒席往御园去了。哈曼见王定意要加罪与他，就起来，求王后以斯帖救命。",
      "en": "In rage the king arose from the banquet of wine and withdrew to the palace garden. Meanwhile, Haman stood to beg Queen Esther for his life,[NOTE:1] for he realized that the king had now determined a catastrophic end for him.[NOTE:2]",
