    {
      "v": 9,
      "zh": "伺候王的一个太监名叫哈波拿，说：「哈曼为那救王有功的末底改做了五丈高的木架，现今立在哈曼家里。」王说：「把哈曼挂在其上。」",
      "en": "Harbona,[NOTE:1] one of the king’s eunuchs, said, “Indeed, there is the gallows that Haman made for Mordecai, who spoke out on the king’s behalf. It stands near Haman’s home and is 75 feet[NOTE:2] high.”The king said, “Hang him on it!”",
      "notes": [
        "Cf. 1:10, where Harbona is one of the seven eunuchs sent by the king to summon Queen Vashti to his banquet.",
        "Heb “50 cubits.” See the note on this expression in Esth 5:14."
